# Requested-time Fourier-reality closure

Every actual requested-time replay stage is a real unforced Galerkin
trajectory.  This module transports that pointwise Fourier-reality law
through the replay's own strong whole-space-time limit, and then through
the faithful transverse inclusion.  Reality is generated by the actual
approximants; it is not an input field of the closure.
-/

